Two-step estimator with bootstrapped standard errors.
----------------------

 ^bootstep^
 
Description
-----------

^avecr^ Two-step estimator with bootstrapped standard errors.
     
^Note:^ Requires bootstep.ado by Olah Data Semarang

Examples
--------

 . ^qbootstep bootstep bootstep_1 | bootstep_2 bootstep_3 bootstep_4 bootstep_5 bootstep_6, nboot(1000) cluster(Id Year)^

